  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">She is favored by fate under one name, and swept away by it in another. Yet never once has she been defeated, nor has she ever yielded.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">Now, witness the defiant Priestess. Witness what keeps her striding forward, never to look back. Witness how she walks the intricate web of destiny and becomes the only answer.<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790611200000/ozezjqhf2qr46xr2jz-1790663786434.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"9328\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790611200000/jxkmn2u2ry849l30zd-1790663498171.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"14128\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790611200000/kw4xe0o5dupem375qo-1790663586277.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"15640\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
